- Deploy: [docs/DEPLOYMENT.md](docs/DEPLOYMENT.md)

This repository uses the projectstarter kit (projectstarter 0.7.6): local CI with a
proof commit, a Codex review loop, a release cycle from `develop` to `main`, and
one way to plan, design and track work: a board artifact in claude.ai and a
before/after page for each UI change.
